    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-healthy-bronchiole-heterogeneous-bronchospasm-ventilation-defect-fraction-at-identical-sigma-kappa-epsilon-mean-0-28-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
